===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|crime}} A [[code of silence]] amongst members of a criminal organization (especially the [[Mafia]]) that forbids [[divulge|divulging]] insider secrets to [[law enforcement]], often also followed outside of the organization in fear of [[retaliation]]; {{lb|en|by extension}} any [[code of silence]].
#: {{syn|en|Sicilian code}}
